^Kubernetes e2e suite (\[sig-node\] NoExecuteTaintManager Multiple Pods evicts pods with minTolerationSeconds \[Conformance\] \[Disruptive\] \[Serial\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] AdmissionWebhook \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should not be able to mutate or prevent deletion of webhook configuration objects \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] FieldValidation should detect duplicates in a CR when preserving unknown fields \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] ValidatingAdmissionPolicy \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should validate against a Deployment \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] Job should manage the lifecycle of a job \[Conformance\]|\[sig-auth\] Projected PodCertificate \[FeatureGate:PodCertificateRequest\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundle\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundleProjection\] MaxExpirationSeconds validations should reject pod creation when MaxExpirationSeconds exceeds maximum \(91d\) \[MinimumKubeletVersion:1\.37\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-cli\] Kubectl client Kubectl run pod should create a pod from an image when restart is Never \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] Ingress API should support creating Ingress API operations \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] ConfigMap should update ConfigMap successfully \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] KubeletManagedEtcHosts should test kubelet managed /etc/hosts file \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Probing container with readiness probe should not be ready before initial delay and never restart \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] \[DRA\] CRUD Tests resource\.k8s\.io/v1 ResourceSlice \[Conformance\]|\[sig-storage\] EmptyDir volumes should support \(non-root,0666,default\) \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Projected downwardAPI should set DefaultMode on files \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\])$
